    "question": "A class has 30 boys and 20 girls. Average age of boys is 15, girls is 12. Class average?",
    "options": [
        "13.2",
        "13.8",
        "14.0",
        "14.5"
    ],
    "answer": 1,
    "explanation": "Total age = 30*15 + 20*12 = 450 + 240 = 690. Average = 690/50 = 13.8."
